OL,3,GNEWSANew #90k city centre planters
OL,4,Adubbed 'ugly lumps'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewly-installed planters in Leicester
OL,7,Fcity centre have been dubbed "ugly
OL,8,Flumpy things" by a councillor.
OL,10,FThe Labour-run city council this week
OL,11,Fplaced a dozen of the planters in
OL,12,FMarket Street, King Street and St
OL,13,FMartin's.
OL,15,FLiberal Democrat city councillor Nigel
OL,16,FPorter has questioned whether the
OL,17,Fplanters' #90,000 cost was good value
OL,18,Ffor tax-payers.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
