OL,3,GNEWSANew #90k city centre planters
OL,4,Adubbed 'ugly lumps'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester's Labour mayor Sir Peter
OL,7,FSoulsby said the planters were
OL,8,F"stylish" and would improve the busy
OL,9,Fshopping streets once they were filled
OL,10,Fwith trees and shrubs.
